  "description": "TSLAppLogger is a high-performance, asynchronous logging library for .NET Framework 4.8,\n\tdesigned for telecom, server, and high-throughput applications.\n\n\tIt provides non-blocking background logging, automatic file rotation and retention,\n\tstructured logging with key-value pairs, optional JSON output, and console logging.\n\tThe logger is thread-safe, GC-optimized using object pooling, and suitable for\n\tlong-running services, Windows services, and telecom call-processing systems.",
